<title>USA: GE to market Catalytica system.</title>
<headline>GE to market Catalytica system.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalytica Combustion Systems Inc., a subsidiary of Catalytica, Inc. and Woodward Governor Co, through their joint venture, Genxon Power Systems, Tuesday said it signed a Memorandum of Understanding has been signed with General Electric Co for the worldwide commercialization of XONON Combustion Systems for GE-designed heavy duty gas turbines.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, GE and GENXON will adapt and apply the XONON system to the requirements of GE's installed turbines. GE will market the XONON system to its worldwide installed base and provide installation and retrofit services.</p>
</text>
